<p>The estimated <b>Price-to-Earnings (P/E) Ratio</b> for <b>Nasdaq 100 Index</b> is <b>27.32</b>, calculated on <b>27 October 2026</b>.</p>

<p>Considering the last 5 years, an average P/E interval is [27.55 , 33.44].
  For this reason, the current P/E can be considered <font class="w3-padding-small pe-under-1 ">Undervalued</font>
</p>

  <p>P/E Ratio is calculated on the <b>QQQ</b> Etf, whose benchmark is the Nasdaq 100 Index.</p>

